# Animate Dead's second half: "When Animate Dead leaves the battlefield, that
# creature's controller sacrifices it". The enters trigger sets up a delayed
# trigger remembering the reanimated creature (RememberObjects$ RememberedLKI);
# Disenchant destroys the Aura and the delayed trigger sacrifices the creature.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
queue paygeneric B
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana human 4 W
tapformana human 5 W
queue paygeneric W
queue targets 1
castspell human 6
resolvestack
